    "detailed_description": "<h1>Remastered run &amp; gun shooter!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/3cd2f7d245a61590453612df85125656.avif?t=1746380129\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metal Slugger Ops is a remastered run-and-gun shooter. Arm yourself with flamethrowers, ray guns, and more to stop Skuntank's evil military plans. Humanity's last hope for peace lies in your hands!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/9aa30e9e2ba54834ec4a784035d213e8.webp?t=1746380129\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/724d94cc7d8d9163ff0ea71c7f72453f.poster.avif?t=1746380129\" width=598 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/724d94cc7d8d9163ff0ea71c7f72453f.webm?t=1746380129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/724d94cc7d8d9163ff0ea71c7f72453f.mp4?t=1746380129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Metal Slugger Ops</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal Slugger Ops is a modern take on classic run-and-gun shooters. Battle waves of enemies, take on tough bosses, and arm yourself with flamethrowers, ray guns, and more to stop Skuntank\u2019s evil plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/86797cfeb2704e767b89f2d9236a5eab.webp?t=1746380129\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/0064c483888ac644ab74939eb2ae927f.poster.avif?t=1746380129\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/0064c483888ac644ab74939eb2ae927f.webm?t=1746380129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/0064c483888ac644ab74939eb2ae927f.mp4?t=1746380129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action, fluid controls, and chaotic combat await. As humanity\u2019s last hope for peace, it\u2019s up to you to defeat Skuntank and save the world!</p>",
