ets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/0064c483888ac644ab74939eb2ae927f.poster.avif?t=1746380129\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/0064c483888ac644ab74939eb2ae927f.webm?t=1746380129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447940/extras/0064c483888ac644ab74939eb2ae927f.mp4?t=1746380129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action, fluid controls, and chaotic combat await. As humanity\u2019s last hope for peace, it\u2019s up to you to defeat Skuntank and save the world!</p>",
